{# ═══════════════ SHELF — trims + the fleet ═══════════════ #}
  <section class="sec shelf" style="--accent:var(--drag)">
    {# Trims are graded and explicitly secondary — walled and omitted, with the
       mount kept so hydration restores the entitled shelf in place. #}
    <div id="etf-trims-mount">{% if not gate and trims %}{% with rows = trims %}{% include "_etf_trim_rows.html.j2" %}{% endwith %}{% endif %}</div>

    {# The fleet — the free tier's anchor, and the one block a crawler most needs
       to see: every named fund, its freshness, and how much history we hold. It
       opens by DEFAULT on both builds (T-B3 ruling): a collapsed <details> may
       never be crawled, and unifying the state keeps the two builds structurally
       identical rather than differing in a way a reader could notice.

       Grouped by how the fund is READ, not alphabetically — because that
       grouping IS the flow-vs-selection rule, so the free page teaches the
       distinction the paid board depends on. It also put the shell back inside
       its 130 KiB budget: the old six-column table was 58 KiB of the page (R3).
       `fund_type` is marshalled onto the coverage rows by build_etf_page; with
       it absent every non-active fund simply lands in the theme group. #}
    <details open>
      <summary class="fl-sum"><span class="sh-ic">{{ icon('radar') }}</span>{{ t('The fleet', '基金阵容') }} <span class="sh-sub">— {{ t('every fund we read, and how current each one is', '我们读取的每一只基金，以及各自的数据新鲜度') }}</span>{{ help('The small figure after each fund is how many daily holdings reads we hold for it: a shallow history means that fund’s numbers exist but have no context yet, a deep one means a streak on that fund is meaningful. Freshness is measured against the newest fund in the fleet rather than against the clock, because sponsors publish on different calendars and a timezone would otherwise manufacture staleness. A fund with no reads at all is a broken feed, not a quiet fund.',
      '每只基金后的小数字，是我们为其保存的每日持仓读取次数：历史越浅，说明该基金的数字虽然存在但尚无参照；历史越深，其连续动作才具备意义。新鲜度以基金阵容中最新的一只为基准衡量，而非以时钟为准——各发行商的披露日历不同，按时钟计会凭空制造出「陈旧」。完全没有读取记录的基金代表数据源中断，而不是该基金没有动作。') }}<span class="sh-caret">▸</span></summary>
      <div class="sh-body">
        {% if coverage %}
        {#- `fleet_group` is marshalled by build_etf_page off the fund registry.
            A coverage row that never saw the builder (a hermetic template test)
            has no group at all, so it falls through to the theme list rather
            than vanishing from the directory. -#}
        {%- set fl_active = coverage | selectattr('fleet_group', 'equalto', 'active') | list -%}
        {%- set fl_sector = coverage | selectattr('fleet_group', 'equalto', 'sector') | list -%}
        {%- set fl_theme = (coverage | selectattr('fleet_group', 'equalto', 'theme') | list)
                         + (coverage | rejectattr('fleet_group', 'defined') | list) -%}
        {%- set fl_current = coverage | rejectattr('stale_days', 'none') | selectattr('stale_days', 'le', 3) | list -%}
